  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u91bf32b1\" id=\"u91bf32b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3cf5efde\" id=\"u3cf5efde\">程序注释主要是对代码进行解释说明,并不参与程序的运行</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue1439329\" id=\"ue1439329\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2cb40a51\" id=\"u2cb40a51\">注释可以分为:</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7197a9c4\" id=\"u7197a9c4\">单行注释</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u07b44307\" id=\"u07b44307\">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u51aaffa8\" id=\"u51aaffa8\">多行注释</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"tIXqM\" id=\"tIXqM\"><span data-lake-id=\"u48e8eac0\" id=\"u48e8eac0\">1.单行注释</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc9dbdbf4\" id=\"uc9dbdbf4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf711c7bc\" id=\"uf711c7bc\">单行注释以#开头,#后跟上注释的内容</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%B8%8B%E9%9D%A2%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%99%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E6%89%93%E6%8B%9B%E5%91%BC%5Cnprint('hello%20%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aElzN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"IuDGO\" id=\"IuDGO\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b73936b\" id=\"u3b73936b\">2.多行注释</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9c97b41c\" id=\"u9c97b41c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a8c05d2\" id=\"u4a8c05d2\">如果注释内容比较多的话,可以使用多行注释</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud38857bd\" id=\"ud38857bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a4e0f53\" id=\"u3a4e0f53\">多行注释以</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5367eaa3\" id=\"u5367eaa3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02b4877d\" id=\"u02b4877d\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ube55e15c\" id=\"ube55e15c\">开头，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u76f17a61\" id=\"u76f17a61\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4e72f978\" id=\"u4e72f978\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u76c1f6fc\" id=\"u76c1f6fc\">结尾。（或以</span><code data-lake-id=\"u118660cd\" id=\"u118660cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u936a90dd\" id=\"u936a90dd\">'''</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u001e86b5\" id=\"u001e86b5\">开头,</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9e6a36ac\" id=\"u9e6a36ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c6c354b\" id=\"u4c6c354b\">'''</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1206f6ff\" id=\"u1206f6ff\">结尾）</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%99%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E6%89%93%E6%8B%9B%E5%91%BC%5Cn%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%98%AF%E7%BB%99%E7%94%B7%E7%A5%9E%E6%89%93%E6%8B%9B%E5%91%BC%5Cn%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cnprint('hello%20%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E')%5Cnprint('hello%20%E9%83%91%E5%B0%91%E7%A7%8B')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m3dNk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
